          "html": "<html>\n<head>\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=iso-8859-1\">\n<style type=\"text/css\" style=\"display:none;\"> P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} </style>\n</head>\n<body dir=\"ltr\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\nHi BrightCare team,</div>\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<br>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\nI'm Akogun Imoleayo. I'd like to know how much a lipid profile costs and</div>\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\nwhether I need to fast beforehand. I'm hoping to book something for this</div>\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\nSaturday if possible.</div>\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<br>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\nThanks,</div>\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\nImoleayo</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "text": "Hi BrightCare team,\n\nI'm Akogun Imoleayo. I'd like to know how much a lipid profile costs and\nwhether I need to fast beforehand. I'm hoping to book something for this\nSaturday if possible.\n\nThanks,\nImoleayo\n",
          "textAsHtml": "<p>Hi BrightCare team,</p><p>I&apos;m Akogun Imoleayo. I&apos;d like to know how much a lipid profile costs and<br/>whether I need to fast beforehand. I&apos;m hoping to book something for this<br/>Saturday if possible.</p><p>Thanks,<br/>Imoleayo</p>",
